            <dataString>reset clk alu-out ctrl-reg-we ir-opcode pc-out reg-b
# auto-generated opcode-probe
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 5 1 0x91 x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
1 0 x x x x x
1 1 x x x x x
</dataString>
